sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant PD as Processes Dashboard
    participant PBM as Process Builder Modal
    participant API as Backend API
    participant PS as Process Service
    participant WS as Worker Service
    participant WM as Worker Manager
    participant TS as Task Service
    participant NS as Notification Service

    Note over U, PBM: Process creation with worker assignment
    U->>PBM: Complete process configuration
    PBM->>U: Show "Process Preview" tab
    PBM->>WS: GET /api/workers/types
    WS->>PBM: Return available worker types
    PBM->>U: Display worker type selector
    
    U->>PBM: Select "Marketing Specialist" for newsletter process
    PBM->>WS: GET /api/workers/marketing-specialist/availability
    WS->>WM: Check worker capacity and availability
    WM->>WS: Return availability status
    WS->>PBM: Marketing specialist available
    PBM->>U: Show "✅ Marketing Specialist - Available"
    
    Note over PBM: Process deployment with worker assignment
    U->>PBM: Click "Create Process"
    PBM->>API: POST /api/processes/create
    API->>PS: Create process with worker assignment
    PS->>WS: POST /api/workers/assign-process
    WS->>WM: Find available marketing specialist
    WM->>WS: Assign process to "Marketing Specialist #1"
    WS->>PS: Worker assignment confirmed
    PS->>API: Process created and assigned
    API->>PBM: Process deployment successful
    
    Note over PBM: Worker notification
    API->>NS: Send worker assignment notification
    NS->>WM: Notify assigned worker
    WM->>WM: Update worker's process queue
    NS->>U: Send confirmation "Process assigned to Marketing Specialist #1"
    
    Note over U, PD: Process execution initiation
    PD->>PS: Monitor new process deployment
    PS->>WS: GET /api/workers/{id}/status
    WS->>PD: Worker ready for process execution
    PD->>U: Show process status "Ready for Execution"
    
    U->>PD: Click "Start Process" on newsletter campaign
    PD->>PS: POST /api/processes/{id}/start
    PS->>WS: Trigger process execution
    WS->>WM: Start process on assigned worker
    WM->>TS: Create initial task for process
    TS->>WM: Task created
    WM->>WS: Process execution started
    WS->>PS: Process running confirmation
    PS->>PD: Update process status to "Running"
    
    Note over WM, TS: Process execution workflow
    WM->>TS: Execute process steps
    TS->>TS: Run newsletter campaign automation
    TS->>WM: Report task progress (25%)
    WM->>WS: Update process progress
    WS->>PD: Push progress update
    PD->>U: Show "Newsletter Campaign - 25% complete"
    
    TS->>WM: Task completed successfully
    WM->>WS: Process execution completed
    WS->>PS: Mark process as completed
    PS->>API: Update process metrics
    API->>PD: Process completion notification
    PD->>U: Show "✅ Newsletter Campaign completed"
    
    Note over U, PD: Worker performance tracking
    PD->>WS: GET /api/workers/performance-metrics
    WS->>WM: Calculate worker performance
    WM->>WS: Return performance data
    WS->>PD: Worker performance metrics
    PD->>U: Update dashboard with worker efficiency
    
    Note over U, PD: Process reassignment workflow
    U->>PD: Click "Reassign" on content creation process
    PD->>WS: GET /api/workers/available-for-reassignment
    WS->>WM: Find available workers for process type
    WM->>WS: Return compatible workers
    WS->>PD: Available workers list
    PD->>U: Show worker selection modal
    
    PD->>U: Display "Content Creator #1 - 75% utilization"
    PD->>U: Display "Content Creator #2 - 45% utilization"
    U->>PD: Select "Content Creator #2"
    
    PD->>WS: POST /api/workers/reassign-process
    WS->>WM: Remove process from current worker
    WM->>WM: Add process to new worker queue
    WM->>WS: Reassignment completed
    WS->>PS: Update process assignment
    PS->>PD: Reassignment confirmed
    PD->>U: Show "Process reassigned to Content Creator #2"
    
    Note over U, PD: Bulk worker assignment
    U->>PD: Select multiple unassigned processes
    U->>PD: Click "Bulk Assign Workers"
    PD->>WS: POST /api/workers/bulk-assign
    WS->>WM: Auto-assign processes to optimal workers
    
    loop For each process
        WM->>WM: Match process type to worker specialty
        WM->>WM: Check worker availability
        WM->>WM: Assign to least utilized worker
    end
    
    WM->>WS: Bulk assignment completed
    WS->>PD: Assignment results
    PD->>U: Show "5 processes assigned successfully"
    
    Note over WS, NS: Worker capacity monitoring
    WS->>WM: Monitor worker utilization
    WM->>WM: Detect overutilization (>90%)
    WM->>NS: Trigger capacity alert
    NS->>U: Send notification "Marketing workers at capacity"
    NS->>PD: Show capacity warning
    PD->>U: Display "⚠️ Consider adding more marketing workers"
    
    Note over U, PD: Worker scaling recommendation
    U->>PD: Click on capacity warning
    PD->>WS: GET /api/workers/scaling-recommendations
    WS->>WM: Analyze workload and performance
    WM->>WS: Return scaling suggestions
    WS->>PD: Scaling recommendations
    PD->>U: Show scaling modal
    PD->>U: Recommend "Add 2 Marketing Specialists"
    PD->>U: Recommend "Add 1 Content Creator"
    
    U->>PD: Click "Add Recommended Workers"
    PD->>WS: POST /api/workers/scale-workforce
    WS->>WM: Create new worker instances
    WM->>WS: New workers ready
    WS->>PD: Workforce scaled successfully
    PD->>U: Show "3 new workers added to team" 